Package: vpn-chain
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Harvey Tseng <verde@nroz.dev>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.38), zlib1g, libasound2t64 | libasound2, libfreetype6, libx11-6, libxext6, libxi6, libxrender1, libxtst6, libcap2, libcap2-bin, nftables, adduser, systemd, polkitd, pkexec
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Verdenroz/vpn-chain
Description: Multi-hop VPN through your own server
 Chains an optional WireGuard entry hop, a VLESS+REALITY relay on your own
 server and the internet into one tunnel. Includes the app, the sing-box it
 drives, a kill switch and the system service that lets it connect without
 a password prompt.
